      Description = """
      {#AlertBoldFormat}{#Prev} {#BountyHighlightFormat} {#Prev} :

      · {#BountyHighlightFormat} {#Prev}

      · {#BountyHighlightFormat} {#Prev} 

      · 

       {#AlertItalicFormat} {#Prev} {#BountyHighlightFormat} {#Prev} {!Icons.Mixer5CommonIcon}{#AlertBoldFormat}{#Prev} {#AlertBoldFormat} {#Prev} {#AlertBoldFormat} {#Prev}{#AlertBoldFormat}{#Prev}!

      {!Icons.DivLong}

      {#AlertItalicFormat}! {#Prev} {!Icons.BountyEyeIcon}  {#BountyHighlightFormat}{#Prev} {#BountyHighlightFormat} {#Prev} {#AlertItalicFormat}!
    """
